     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Dear all,</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">during 10-14 June 2024 we teach a 5-day workshop on\r\n<i>&quot;</i></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><i>Modeling distribution, abundance, demography and population dynamics using R, JAGS and NIMBLE&quot;</i> at the Spanish Game Research\r\n Center (IREC) in Ciudad Real, Spain. You can get there very conveniently in 1h taking the bullet train from Madrid. Please see attached program for more information on content and for how to apply. </span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Instructor team includes\r\n</span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Michael Schaub</span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,\r\n Gurutzeta Guillera-Arroita</span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">, José Lahoz-Monfort</span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,\r\n</span><span lang=\"ES\" style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Ta